# Release signing. keystore.properties holds the passwords and points at a keystore kept
# outside this repository; neither may ever be committed. Back both up somewhere safe:
# without the keystore, the installed app can't be updated, only reinstalled (losing its data).
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
